---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  variant="home"
  title="Live Transcription for Online Courses & Professional Training | Audicap"
  description="Turn online course and professional training audio in Chrome into live transcripts you can revisit, summarize, and export. No downloads or uploads. Free to start."
  canonical="https://audicap.work/"
  hreflangs={[
    { lang: 'en', url: 'https://audicap.work/' },
    { lang: 'es', url: 'https://audicap.work/es/' },
    { lang: 'zh-Hant', url: 'https://audicap.work/zh-hant/' },
    { lang: 'x-default', url: 'https://audicap.work/' }
  ]}
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <meta name="keywords" content="online course transcription, professional training transcript, lecture transcription, Udemy transcription, Coursera transcription, Canvas lecture transcript, training video notes, Chrome course transcription" />
    <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "SoftwareApplication",
        "name": "Audicap",
        "description": "Chrome extension for turning online courses and professional training audio into live transcripts learners can revisit, summarize, and export.",
        "url": "https://audicap.work",
        "applicationCategory": "BrowserExtension",
        "operatingSystem": "Chrome",
        "offers": [
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "name": "Free Trial",
            "price": "0",
            "priceCurrency": "USD",
            "description": "30 free minutes on signup, with referral rewards for inviting new users"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "name": "Starter",
            "price": "2.99",
            "priceCurrency": "USD",
            "description": "100 credits"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "name": "Standard",
            "price": "9.99",
            "priceCurrency": "USD",
            "description": "500 credits"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "name": "Pro",
            "price": "19.99",
            "priceCurrency": "USD",
            "description": "1200 credits + 200 bonus"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "name": "Ultimate",
            "price": "39.99",
            "priceCurrency": "USD",
            "description": "3000 credits + 600 bonus"
          }
        ]
      }
    </script>
  </Fragment>

  <section id="product" class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-layout">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="hero-eyebrow"><span></span>Live transcription for professional learning</div>
        <h1>Turn online courses into transcripts you can actually use.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">Audicap captures course and training audio playing in Chrome, turns it into a live transcript, and keeps it ready for notes, review, and export.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/audicap/cfalkkjbhiohkomajlelefmllnoniloo?utm_source=audicap_website&amp;utm_medium=seo&amp;utm_campaign=home_professional_learning" class="btn btn-primary">Add to Chrome — free <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a href="#workflow" class="text-link">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <ul class="hero-assurance" aria-label="Getting started details">
          <li>No card required</li>
          <li>No monthly subscription</li>
          <li>No meeting bot</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="hero-platforms">
          <span>Works with learning in regular Chrome tabs</span>
          <div><b>Coursera</b><b>Udemy</b><b>Canvas</b><b>edX</b><b>Training portals</b></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="product-stage" aria-label="Preview of the current Audicap Chrome extension while recording a course tab">
        <div class="homepage-plugin-shell seo-page">
          <div class="plugin-preview homepage-plugin-preview" role="img" aria-label="Audicap Chrome extension Live view with sample professional course transcription">
            <div class="plugin-preview-header">
              <strong class="plugin-preview-logo">Audicap</strong>
              <div class="plugin-preview-header-actions">
                <span class="plugin-referral-button">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 12v9H4v-9M2 7h20v5H2zM12 7v14M12 7H7.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 2.1-3.85L12 7Zm0 0h4.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 0-2.1-3.85L12 7Z"></path></svg>
                  <span>Free Minutes</span>
                </span>
                <span class="plugin-credits-display">
                  <span aria-hidden="true">💎</span><strong>84</strong><small>min</small><i>+</i><i>↻</i>
                </span>
                <span class="plugin-settings-button" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M4.2 5.4h4.1m3.4 0h4.1M4.2 10h1.6m3.4 0h6.6M4.2 14.6h6.6m3.4 0h1.6"></path><circle cx="10" cy="5.4" r="1.5"></circle><circle cx="7.5" cy="10" r="1.5"></circle><circle cx="12.5" cy="14.6" r="1.5"></circle></svg>
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="plugin-preview-main">
              <div class="plugin-capture-panel">
                <div class="plugin-capture-status">
                  <span class="plugin-recording-dot"></span>
                  <div class="plugin-capture-copy"><strong>Recording this tab</strong><small>Capturing this tab. 13 min used.</small></div>
                </div>
                <div class="plugin-capture-actions">
                  <span class="plugin-stop-button">Stop Recording</span>
                  <div class="plugin-recording-meta"><span></span><strong>Recording</strong><b>12:18</b><small>Used 13 min · 71 min left</small></div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="plugin-secondary-controls">
                <div class="plugin-billing-row"><span>Balance: 84 min</span><span>1 credit = 1 minute</span><span>No subscription</span></div>
                <div class="plugin-recognition-row"><div><small>Recognition</small><strong>Default Mode</strong></div><span>Change</span></div>
              </div>

              <div class="plugin-workspace-tabs">
                <span class="plugin-workspace-tab active">Live</span>
                <span class="plugin-workspace-tab">History <i class="plugin-history-count">8</i></span>
              </div>

              <div class="plugin-transcription">
                <div class="plugin-transcription-head">
                  <h3>Live Transcription</h3>
                  <div class="plugin-toolbar" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="plugin-tool"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h9M9 3v2M10 5c-.8 4-2.9 6.4-6 8M5 8c1.2 2.2 3 3.8 5.5 5M14 19l4-9 4 9M15.5 16h5"></path></svg></span>
                    <span class="plugin-tool active"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"></circle><path d="M12 8v4l3 2"></path></svg></span>
                    <span class="plugin-tool"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="11" rx="2" width="11" x="8" y="8"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg></span>
                    <span class="plugin-tool"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 4v10M8 10l4 4 4-4M5 20h14"></path></svg></span>
                    <span class="plugin-tool"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 7h16M10 11v6M14 11v6M6 7l1 14h10l1-14M9 7V4h6v3"></path></svg></span>
                    <span class="plugin-tool"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M10 13a4 4 0 0 0 5.7 0l2.1-2.1a4 4 0 0 0-5.7-5.7l-1.2 1.2M14 11a4 4 0 0 0-5.7 0l-2.1 2.1a4 4 0 0 0 5.7 5.7l1.2-1.2"></path></svg></span>
                    <span class="plugin-tool"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l1.4 4.1L17.5 8.5l-4.1 1.4L12 14l-1.4-4.1-4.1-1.4 4.1-1.4zM18 14l.8 2.2L21 17l-2.2.8L18 20l-.8-2.2L15 17l2.2-.8z"></path></svg></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="plugin-transcription-box">
                  <div class="plugin-segment"><time>12:06</time><span>The teach-back method checks how clearly we explained the treatment plan.</span></div>
                  <div class="plugin-segment partial"><time>...</time><span>Ask the patient to describe the next step in their own words.</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="plugin-stats"><span>Words: <b>28</b></span><span>Characters: <b>176</b></span><span>⏱️ <b>738s</b></span><span>💎 Credits left: <b>71</b></span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="preview-caption">Current extension controls · Sample course content</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="signal-strip" aria-label="Product principles">
    <div class="container signal-grid">
      <div><span>01</span><strong>Chrome tab audio</strong><small>Works where the course already plays</small></div>
      <div><span>02</span><strong>No file workflow</strong><small>No downloading and re-uploading videos</small></div>
      <div><span>03</span><strong>Learning history</strong><small>Return to the source and transcript</small></div>
      <div><span>04</span><strong>Pay as you learn</strong><small>Credits instead of another subscription</small></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="workflow" class="learning-workflow">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading split">
        <div><span class="section-label">How it works</span><h2>From the active Chrome tab to History in four steps.</h2></div>
        <p>This is the same control flow you will see inside Audicap. No course download or audio-file upload is required.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="workflow-grid">
        <article class="workflow-step">
          <span class="step-number">01</span>
          <div class="step-rule"></div>
          <h3>Open the course tab</h3>
          <p>Play the lesson, certification module, lecture, or training video in a regular desktop Chrome tab.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="workflow-step">
          <span class="step-number">02</span>
          <div class="step-rule"></div>
          <h3>Press Start Recording</h3>
          <p>Open Audicap, sign in if prompted, and start the active tab. If Chrome requests authorization, click the Audicap toolbar icon once.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="workflow-step">
          <span class="step-number">03</span>
          <div class="step-rule"></div>
          <h3>Follow the Live view</h3>
          <p>Keep the course playing while transcript segments appear. Use translation, timestamps, copy, or export controls when needed.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="workflow-step">
          <span class="step-number">04</span>
          <div class="step-rule"></div>
          <h3>Stop, then open History</h3>
          <p>Press Stop Recording to save the session. Open it in History to review, add notes, mark it for later, share, summarize, or export.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="control-grid" aria-label="Audicap workflow details">
        <div><strong>Active Chrome tab</strong><span>Audicap captures the normal tab where audio is playing.</span></div>
        <div><strong>Chrome authorization</strong><span>A toolbar click may be required before capture begins.</span></div>
        <div><strong>Live controls</strong><span>Translation, timestamps, copy, export, and sharing stay visible.</span></div>
        <div><strong>Saved after Stop</strong><span>The completed transcript becomes available in History.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="use-cases" class="use-case-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="section-label">Where Audicap fits</span>
        <h2>For learning where missing one explanation costs you later.</h2>
        <p>These scenarios reflect the strongest patterns in real paid usage: repeated, information-dense learning tied to professional work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="use-case-list">
        <article class="use-case-item">
          <span class="case-number">A</span>
          <div class="case-copy"><small>PROFESSIONAL EDUCATION</small><h3>Long-form online courses</h3><p>Preserve technical explanations across Coursera, Udemy, Canvas, edX, and private learning portals.</p></div>
          <ul><li>Live transcript</li><li>Source-linked history</li><li>Notes and review</li></ul>
        </article>
        <article class="use-case-item">
          <span class="case-number">B</span>
          <div class="case-copy"><small>SPECIALIST LANGUAGE</small><h3>Medical and interpreter training</h3><p>Keep dense terminology visible during continuing education, domain practice, and specialist lectures.</p></div>
          <ul><li>Multilingual capture</li><li>Optional translation</li><li>Full transcript export</li></ul>
        </article>
        <article class="use-case-item">
          <span class="case-number">C</span>
          <div class="case-copy"><small>CAREER DEVELOPMENT</small><h3>Certification and product training</h3><p>Turn HubSpot Academy, webinars, and role-specific training into material you can reference while doing the work.</p></div>
          <ul><li>Pay-as-you-go credits</li><li>Searchable history</li><li>Summary on demand</li></ul>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="section-action"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/use-cases/">View all learning use cases <span>→</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="pricing" class="pricing">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading split pricing-heading">
        <div><span class="section-label">Simple pricing</span><h2>Buy learning time.<br />Not another subscription.</h2></div>
        <div class="free-start"><strong>30 minutes free</strong><p>Start without a card. Install Audicap and use the free minutes on a real lesson.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="pricing-subtitle">1 credit = 1 minute of real-time transcription. Purchased credits are valid for 30 days.</p>
      <div class="credits-grid">
        <article class="credit-card">
          <div class="plan-name"><span>Starter</span><small>For one short course</small></div>
          <div class="credit-amount">100 <small>minutes</small></div>
          <div class="credit-price">$2.99</div>
          <div class="credit-unit">$0.0299 per minute</div>
          <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/audicap/cfalkkjbhiohkomajlelefmllnoniloo?utm_source=audicap_website&amp;utm_medium=seo&amp;utm_campaign=pricing_starter" class="plan-link">Get Audicap <span>→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="credit-card featured">
          <span class="pricing-badge">Most selected</span>
          <div class="plan-name"><span>Standard</span><small>For an active course</small></div>
          <div class="credit-amount">500 <small>minutes</small></div>
          <div class="credit-price">$9.99</div>
          <div class="credit-unit">$0.0200 per minute · Save 33%</div>
          <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/audicap/cfalkkjbhiohkomajlelefmllnoniloo?utm_source=audicap_website&amp;utm_medium=seo&amp;utm_campaign=pricing_standard" class="plan-link">Get Audicap <span>→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="credit-card">
          <div class="plan-name"><span>Pro</span><small>For ongoing training</small></div>
          <div class="credit-amount">1,400 <small>minutes</small></div>
          <div class="credit-price">$19.99</div>
          <div class="credit-unit">Includes 200 bonus · Save 52%</div>
          <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/audicap/cfalkkjbhiohkomajlelefmllnoniloo?utm_source=audicap_website&amp;utm_medium=seo&amp;utm_campaign=pricing_pro" class="plan-link">Get Audicap <span>→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="credit-card">
          <div class="plan-name"><span>Ultimate</span><small>For intensive learning</small></div>
          <div class="credit-amount">3,600 <small>minutes</small></div>
          <div class="credit-price">$39.99</div>
          <div class="credit-unit">Includes 600 bonus · Save 63%</div>
          <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/audicap/cfalkkjbhiohkomajlelefmllnoniloo?utm_source=audicap_website&amp;utm_medium=seo&amp;utm_campaign=pricing_ultimate" class="plan-link">Get Audicap <span>→</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="pricing-policy">
        <span>Included with every plan</span>
        <ul><li>Live transcription</li><li>Real-time translation</li><li>Learning history</li><li>Transcript export</li><li>Secure sharing</li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container faq-layout">
      <div><span class="section-label">Questions</span><h2>Before your first lesson.</h2><p class="faq-intro">Need a policy detail? Read our <a href="/privacy.html">privacy policy</a>, <a href="/terms.html">terms</a>, or <a href="/refund.html">refund policy</a>.</p></div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details><summary>Does Audicap replace the course player?</summary><p>No. Keep the original course open and playing in Chrome. Audicap captures the tab audio you choose and displays the transcript alongside your learning workflow.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Do I need to download or upload the course video?</summary><p>No video download or file upload is required. Start Audicap while the lesson plays in a regular Chrome tab.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is Audicap a meeting bot?</summary><p>No. Audicap does not join a class or call as another participant. It works from the Chrome tab you select.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How does pricing work?</summary><p>One credit equals one minute of real-time transcription. New accounts receive 30 free minutes, and purchased credits remain valid for 30 days.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="final-cta">
    <div class="container final-cta-inner">
      <div><span class="section-label light">Ready when the lesson starts</span><h2>Keep the part you would otherwise replay.</h2></div>
      <div><p>Install Audicap, open a real course, and use the first 30 minutes free.</p><a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/audicap/cfalkkjbhiohkomajlelefmllnoniloo?utm_source=audicap_website&amp;utm_medium=seo&amp;utm_campaign=home_final_cta" class="btn btn-primary">Add Audicap to Chrome <span>→</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
